{"id":988,"type":"l","tags":["Alertes"],"name":"Alertes information importante ","htmlstr":"<div class=\"container-fluid\" data-selected=\"1\" draggable=\"true\">\n<div class=\"row flex-md-row justify-content-md-center\">\n<div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"alert position-relative alert-info mt-5 mb-3\" style=\"padding: 1.5rem 2.5rem;\">\n<div class=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: -15px; left: -9px; width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1rem; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 0px 2px 6px; padding-right: 4px; background-color: #005b7f;\" data-darkreader-inline-boxshadow=\"\" data-darkreader-inline-bgcolor=\"\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa-solid fa-info fa-1x\" style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 21px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div>\n<strong>Titre de l'alerte</strong><br>Cette alerte présente une information essentielle à consulter ou une action à accomplir par la personne apprenante.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","img":"data:image/png;base64,","userid":506}
